  },
  "notes": [
    "15 stations, not the 29 quoted in the canIbreathe operator-directory report or the 16 in the STAC collection description. The metadata CSV is authoritative.",
    "The automatic network measures 7 taxa hourly since 2023-01-01. Only alnus, betula and poaceae overlap with Open-Meteo/CAMS, so only those three are verifiable.",
    "tz is UTC on purpose: MeteoSwiss publishes its timestamps in UTC, so sampling the forecast in UTC removes a timezone conversion from the pairing step. A 1h error would corrupt the timing metric, which is the whole point of the study.",
    "alps: N = north of the Alps, S = south (Mediterranean-influenced, most transferable to Catalonia), A = alpine/high-altitude (least transferable). Used to segment results."
